property became little,</i> or <i>scanty.</i> (TA.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2- 
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَا أَسْخَفَهُ</span> <i>How</i> [<i>slender, shallow, weak,</i>] <i>deficient,</i>
